    "font" : "ArialMT",
    "font size" : 9.48,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "Please see the following information on air and ground transportation. If you haven’t registered for this conference, please go online to www.symposiamedicus.org to register."
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 8,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 36.0, 578.917, 553.739, 602.456 ],
    "font" : "ArialMT",
    "font size" : 9.48,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "If you have any questions, please do not hesitate to contact us at (925) 969-1789, Monday-Friday, 8:30am-5:00pm, (Pacific Time) or email travel-tours@symposiamedicus.org."
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 10,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 36.0, 480.276, 205.359, 569.931 ],
    "font" : "Arial-BoldMT",
    "font size" : 9.48,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "HOTEL INFORMATION LOEWS VENTANA CANYON RESORT 7000 N. Resort Drive Tucson, Arizona 85750 Phone: (520) 299-2020 AIR TRAVEL INFORMATION"
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 15,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 36.0, 436.593, 287.864, 471.413 ],
    "font" : "ArialMT",
    "font size" : 9.48,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "The closest airport to the Loews Ventana Canyon Resort is Tucson International Airport (TUS); however, lower fares can sometimes be found by flying into Phoenix Sky Harbor"
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 16,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 36.0, 404.19, 284.635, 438.887 ],
    "font" : "ArialMT",
    "font size" : 9.48,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "International Airport (PHX). Tucson is approximately a 40 minute drive to the hotel, while Phoenix is approximately a 2 hour drive."
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 17,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 36.0, 327.63, 276.675, 394.966 ],
    "font" : "ArialMT",
    "font size" : 9.48,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "Symposia Medicus has arranged for discount fares with Alaska, Delta, and United Airlines for this conference. To view more information, including airline discount codes, please visit the Conference Registration, Lodging, and Travel Information section of our online brochure at https://bit.ly/38OuBcF"
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 19,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 36.0, 283.598, 214.737, 318.651 ],
    "font" : "Arial-BoldMT",
    "font size" : 9.48,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "GROUND TRANSPORTATION OPTIONS Option #1 – Car Rental"
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 21,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 36.0, 206.438, 284.759, 275.099 ],
    "font" : "ArialMT",
    "font size" : 9.48,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "We recommend that you rent a car to see the many sites of Tucson and the surrounding area. Symposia Medicus has arranged conference discounts with AVIS and Budget Car Rentals. Reservations can be made online or by phone. Please refer to the conference code and the airport location when making your reservations."
